{
	"title": "Timeline: a reaction with to overrides the state until the next point or a restart",
	"description": "A heating with a comfort button (a reaction with to: comfort) and the points 06:00 comfort, 22:00 night. Booted at 21:00 it enters comfort; 22:00 night (the exit action of comfort logs). The button at 22:30 brings comfort back: the manual override. A reboot at 23:00 evaluates the timeline: night again, the override is gone. The button at 23:10 overrides again; the point 06:00 re-enters comfort although the rule is in it: a self-transition with the exit and entry actions, the mode sent again.",
